  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">I enlighet med Sidas utv&#xe4;rderingsplan skall Sida genomf&#xf6;ra en studie av utvecklingssamarbetet med Laos, Sri Lanka och Vietnam.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In line with Sida&apos;s strategic evaluation plan, Sida will commission an evaluation of the development co-operation between Sweden and Sri Lanka, Vietnam and Laos. The study period for the Vietnam report will cover around 45 years of co-operation.</narrative>
